1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
EP006 Couch Coins

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,200
Still want that divorce?

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,000
Eat. One kiss didn't change the contract.

4
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,600
Another wedding already?

5
00:00:13,845 --> 00:00:16,085
Dress return. I need the deposit back.

6
00:00:16,085 --> 00:00:17,765
Keep it. I'll buy it.

7
00:00:17,765 --> 00:00:20,085
With what? Couch coins?

8
00:00:23,365 --> 00:00:26,645
Found those under my bag. Don't spend it all at once.

9
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:40,230
Find out what the Quinns have been doing to her.

10
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:40,950
On it, boss.

11
00:00:42,475 --> 00:00:45,595
Her father left. Natalie and her mother got nothing.

12
00:00:48,315 --> 00:00:52,315
She's been paying for treatment alone. They offered help only if she took Cassie's place.

13
00:00:53,370 --> 00:00:54,570
They sold her.

14
00:00:56,410 --> 00:00:59,290
The fifty thousand arrived. It won't cover everything.

15
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:02,090
Pay the balance. Every future treatment, too.

16
00:01:04,083 --> 00:01:06,083
Hospital payment confirmed.

17
00:01:06,665 --> 00:01:08,265
What name do I give her?

18
00:01:09,305 --> 00:01:10,345
Not mine.

19
00:01:12,905 --> 00:01:14,345
Your car's downstairs.

20
00:01:16,905 --> 00:01:18,105
She still thinks you're broke.

21
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:20,200
Let her.

22
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:24,280
Where are you going?

23
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:28,760
To my wife. Her family had their fun. Now it's my turn.

